            {
                "entry_id": "89568d35-7b84-3b6d-b7a8-385d06f99582",
                "word": "wolnego",
                "pos": "intj",
                "lang_code": "pl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6e1832f-1807-3be3-a3c5-6203ad77cd4d",
                        "entry_id": "89568d35-7b84-3b6d-b7a8-385d06f99582",
                        "glosses": [
                            "cool your heels!, cool your jets!, hold your horses!, stop!, whoa! (slow down)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3700234c-b532-4437-8ea3-49ed856f65d8",
                                "sense_id": "e6e1832f-1807-3be3-a3c5-6203ad77cd4d",
                                "text": "– Trzeba by koniecznie zobaczyć ten wóz. Malina uśmiechnął się. – Wolnego, Stefek, wolnego. Wszystko się zrobi.",
                                "translation": "– We should really take a look at that carriage. Malina smiled. – Slow down, Stefek, slow down. All in good time.",
                                "english": "– We should really take a look at that carriage. Malina smiled. – Slow down, Stefek, slow down. All in good time."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0f6542da-d121-305f-a948-68b50545e385",
                        "entry_id": "89568d35-7b84-3b6d-b7a8-385d06f99582",
                        "glosses": [
                            "stop!, whoa! (you should not have done/said that)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bcc7aedb-4ae8-4732-80ae-74ef6b3cd43d",
                                "sense_id": "0f6542da-d121-305f-a948-68b50545e385",
                                "text": "– A, dobrze, że cię widzę. Od jutra możesz sobie szukać innej pracy. Podawanie w „Monopolu” to nie jest praktyka dla dyletantów, zrozumiano? Kelner spojrzał na niego z ukosa: – Wolnego! Co za ty? Świń z panem nie pasałem. Sobie możesz pan od jutra wymówić.",
                                "translation": "– Ah, it's good to see you. You can look for another job from tomorrow. Serving at the “Monopoly” is not an apprenticeship for dilettantes, understood? The waiter gave him a sidelong glance: – Wait a minute! What do you mean by “you”? I don't remember being on first-name terms with you. So good luck firing me.",
                                "english": "– Ah, it's good to see you. You can look for another job from tomorrow. Serving at the “Monopoly” is not an apprenticeship for dilettantes, understood? The waiter gave him a sidelong glance: – Wait a minute! What do you mean by “you”? I don't remember being on first-name terms with you. So good luck firing me."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
